      },
      "message": "perf(kernel): instrument the step import stages\n\nTracing-only timings with the stable stage names (parse, topology,\nbuild, mesh_plan, mesh_deviation, weld, facets) on the STEP read path,\nthe machining-mesh plan/measure/evaluate/weld path and the per-solid\nmesh loop. A new ignored release-lane bench row reads the #4200 repro\nrotor from CAMCRAFT_ROTOR_STEP and prints the timings; without the file\nit skips. No behaviour or verdict changes.\n\nThe rotor profile: read ~20 s; the mesh stages dominate (mesh_deviation\n115-167 s per attempt over 88-95M samples; mesh_plan 18-65 s), and the\n0.005 mm attempt plus the loose-chord 0.01 mm path is ~640 s of work,\npast the 300 s bound.\n\nRefs #4200",
