      "message": "fix(kernel): review fixes for the step import instrumentation\n\nThe bench row no longer defaults to a personal Windows path: without\nCAMCRAFT_ROTOR_STEP it prints that it skipped and returns, on every\nsystem. The per-parse progress and per-stage/per-attempt timing lines\nare tracing::debug! now; the bench sets its own camcraft_kernel=debug\nfilter and still prints them. The stage key of the progress guard is\nthe stage name, not its length. The Cargo.toml comment names #4200\nbeside #163.\n\nRefs #4200",
